cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it and the article it reproduces, and cite the data sources as indicated in docs/DATA_SOURCES.md."
type: software
title: 'Reproduction package for "Taxing the Gains from Foreign AI: Fiscal Capture Frontiers in Developing Economies"'
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
authors:
