abstract: >-
  Code, stored inputs and accepted results that reproduce the capture ceilings, frontier meshes, confrontation with the
  cost of universal social protection and post-base sensitivities of the article "Taxing the Gains from Foreign AI:
  Fiscal Capture Frontiers in Developing Economies" and its technical supplement. Single entry point run.ps1 (Windows).
  The DOI of this package will be added when it is deposited.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - taxation
  - withholding tax
  - fiscal capture
  - developing economies
  - reproducibility
references:
